TI  - Multimodal cerebral imaging study on the effects of "Adjust Zang Dredge Meridian" electroacupuncture on cerebral central sensitization in PDPN patients: a study protocol for a sham-controlled, randomized trial
T2  - TRIALS
LA  - English
KW  - Electropuncture
