TI  - Voxel-based morphometry demonstrates reduced grey matter density on brain MRI in patients with diabetic retinopathy
T2  - DIABETOLOGIA
LA  - English
KW  - brain MRI
KW  - grey matter density
KW  - microvascular complications
KW  - type 1 diabetes
KW  - ALZHEIMERS-DISEASE
