TI  - MR neurography of lumbosacral nerve roots for differentiating CIDP from acquired axonal polyneuropathies: a cross-sectional study
T2  - QUANTITATIVE IMAGING IN MEDICINE AND SURGERY
LA  - English
KW  - Chronic inflammatory demyelinating polyneuropathy (CIDP)
KW  - axonal degeneration
