TI  - A Fully-Automatic Segmentation of the Carpal Tunnel from Magnetic Resonance Images Based on the Convolutional Neural Network-Based Approach
T2  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL AND BIOLOGICAL ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - Magnetic resonance
