TI  - Dorsal Root Ganglia Volume-Normative Values, Correlation with Demographic Determinants and Reliability of Three Different Methods of Volumetry
T2  - DIAGNOSTICS
LA  - English
KW  - magnetic resonance neurography
KW  - dorsal root ganglia
